 "speech": {
  "language": "en",
  "text": "We work on videos probably three or four months in advance. But before that, like, they're set in ideation where we brainstorm what they are for a month or two. So from the start to when they get uploaded, it's probably like one to two months. Coming up with the idea, three to four months working on the idea then a couple weeks filming and then like three weeks editing. So probably five months from start to finish. Two years ago, we were spending grand a video. Now we're spending probably 1 .5 million a video.",
